==District 10==
{{see also|Washington's 10th congressional district}}
The 10th congressional district encompasses the state capital of [[Olympia, Washington|Olympia]] and surrounding areas. The district has a [[Cook Partisan Voting Index|PVI]] of D+5. The incumbent is Democrat [[Dennis Heck|Denny Heck]], who has represented the district since 2013. He was re-elected with 59% of the vote in 2016.
